flowchart LR
  U([用户需求<br/>文字 / 图片 / 视频])
  UI[Web 工作台]
  OC[OpenClaw<br/>对话入口]
  S[video-agent<br/>项目、任务、路由与版本]
  PLAN[理解与策划<br/>素材证据、商品事实、场景、分镜]
  ADAPT[HyperFrames 适配层<br/>资源选择、原生工程、编译]
  HF[HyperFrames 0.8.33<br/>检查、预览、渲染]
  OUT([候选视频 + 可编辑工程])
  REVIEW{质量检查与交付门禁}

  U --> UI --> S
  U --> OC --> S
  S --> PLAN --> ADAPT --> HF --> OUT --> REVIEW
  REVIEW -->|需要修改| PLAN
  REVIEW -->|满足交付条件| DONE([正式交付])

  classDef entry fill:#E7F3F1,stroke:#477D73,color:#173B36
  classDef agent fill:#EEF0FA,stroke:#6875A5,color:#252D55
  classDef hf fill:#FFF2D9,stroke:#B18338,color:#4A3516
  classDef result fill:#EAF2E6,stroke:#62824D,color:#263A1D
  class U,UI,OC entry
  class S,PLAN,REVIEW agent
  class ADAPT,HF hf
  class OUT,DONE result
